  {
   "id": "map-ancestor-directory-walk-pattern",
   "description": "A hand-rolled loop of dirname()+access()/statSync() walking upward from a start directory looking for a marker file maps to findAncestorMarkerFile({start, marker}) from @red-cup-engineering/find-ancestor-marker-file-service@0.1.0.",
   "detectable": "not by single-call-site matching -- this is a multi-statement control-flow pattern (a loop containing dirname and access/exists calls), not one call form. The fabricated read-node-builtin-usage operation matches individual call sites only and reports each dirname/access call under its own mapping id (gap-path-dirname is a gap; fs/promises.access is gap-fs-promises-access); a separate pattern-detection pass would be needed to find this composite shape."
  }
 ],
